  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Service level objectives",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How SLOs are computed",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n**Objective:** 99.5 % of calls succeed (non-5xx) over 30 days \u2192 **error budget = 0.5 %**.\n\n* **Gateway-wide SLIs & burn rates** come from Prometheus *recording rules*\n  (`prometheus/rules/gravitee-slo.rules.yml`) \u2014 cheap to evaluate, alertable.\n* **Alerts** use the Google SRE multi-window, multi-burn-rate pattern:\n  *page* at 14.4\u00d7 (5m & 1h), *ticket* at 6\u00d7 (30m & 6h).\n* **Per-API** compliance is computed from the analytics store, which knows\n  the API, plan and application of every call.\n\nChange the objective in the rules file and in the per-API table transformation.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability SLI (30d)",
      "description": "Gateway-wide share of non-5xx calls over 30 days (Prometheus recording rule).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds_prom}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds_prom}"
          },
          "expr": "gravitee:sli_availability:ratio_rate30d",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "hide": false,
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
